type: software
title: "WHIR (Wearable Health Interoperable Recordings) Implementation Guide"
version: 0.1.0
abstract: >-
  FHIR R5 implementation guide for wearable inertial measurement unit (IMU)
  recordings, from device and sensor metadata through raw data to activity
  labels, with use cases for machine learning and automatic geriatric
  assessment at home.
